        <Param val="Welcome to the experiment!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will be presented with 4 lines. Each time there is an triangle above any of the lines you have to press a key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;When you see a triangle aobve the left most line press Z. When you see a triangle above the second line, press X, for triangle above third line, press C and for a triangle above fourth line, press V.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So the keys you can press are Z, X, C &amp; V.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press space to begin the experiment." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
